# QT3 test case CastAs312 of test set prod-CastExpr, which tests the XPath expression
#   xs:yearMonthDuration("P1Y2M") cast as xs:dayTimeDuration
# The test case is defined at https://github.com/w3c/qt3tests/blob/201a6e466940cdfc727f4babfedcde5332b9f578/prod/CastExpr.xml#L3249
# The test needs the constructor function xsd:yearMonthDuration, xsd:dayTimeDuration on xsd:yearMonthDuration, the constructor function xsd:dayTimeDuration, xsd:string on xsd:dayTimeDuration, which SPARQL does not define
ASK {
  BIND(<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dayTimeDuration> ( <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#yearMonthDuration> ( "P1Y2M" ) ) AS ?result)
  FILTER(( <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> ( ?result ) = "PT0S" ))
}
